### Create Road Detection

POST http://localhost:5000/api/detections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "damageType": "Pothole",
  "severity": "High",
  "confidence": 0.94,
  "mediaType": "Image",
  "mediaUrl": "/uploads/test-pothole.jpg",
  "location": {
    "address": "NH-48, Sector 12",
    "latitude": 28.6139,
    "longitude": 77.2090
  },
  "aiModel": "YOLOv8 RoadGuard",
  "modelVersion": "1.0.0",
  "status": "Detected",
  "description": "Large pothole detected on the road surface"
}


### Get All Detections

GET http://localhost:5000/api/detections


### Upload Road Image

POST http://localhost:5000/api/uploads/image
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RoadGuardBoundary

--RoadGuardBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="road-test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./road-test.jpg
--RoadGuardBoundary--